%[text]  $G(s) = \\frac{X(s)}{U(s)} = \\frac{1}{ms^2 + ks}${"altText":"G(s) = \frac{X(s)}{U(s)} = \frac{1}{ms^2 + ks}"}
%[text] Plot the impulse response of $G${"altText":"G"} for the first 100 seconds using MATLAB commands by
%[text] 1. creating the transfer function using the `tf` function
%[text] 2. plotting the impulse response using `impulse` function \
